<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Random Activity Picker | Choose What To Do</title><meta name="description" content="Add activities that suit your time, place and budget, then randomly choose one. Includes starter lists for home, classroom and outdoors."><meta name="robots" content="index,follow"><link rel="canonical" href="https://wheelnamepicker.com.au/activity-picker"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/value-pages.css"></head><body><div class="top"><div class="nav"><a class="brand" href="/">Wheel Name Picker</a><div class="links"><a href="/dinner-picker">Dinner Picker</a><a href="/weekday-picker">Weekday Picker</a><a href="/picture-picker">Picture Picker</a></div></div></div><header class="hero"><span class="badge">Idea selector</span><h1>Random Activity Picker</h1><p>Start with activities that are genuinely possible right now, then let the picker choose. Load a starter list or replace it completely with your own ideas.</p></header><main class="wrap"><div class="tool"><div class="grid"><div class="field"><label for="items">Activities</label><textarea id="items">Board game
Short walk
Draw something
Watch a movie
Bake something
Read together
Do a puzzle
Music session</textarea></div><div class="field"><label for="preset">Starter list</label><select id="preset"><option value="home">At home</option><option value="class">Classroom brain break</option><option value="outside">Outside</option></select><div class="actions"><button id="load">Load list</button><button id="pick">Pick an activity</button></div></div></div><div class="result big-choice" id="result">What should we do?</div></div><div class="article"><section><h2>Randomise after filtering</h2><p>An activity picker works best when every option on the list already fits the situation. Remove ideas that need equipment you do not have, cost more than you want to spend, depend on unsuitable weather or are not appropriate for the people taking part. Then random selection becomes a quick tie-breaker between acceptable choices.</p></section><section><h2>Three starter lists</h2><p>The built-in presets are prompts, not rules. The home list focuses on simple indoor activities, the classroom list contains short low-equipment brain breaks, and the outside list contains general outdoor ideas. Edit any list to suit your space, ages, abilities and supervision needs.</p></section><section><h2>Useful ways to structure a list</h2><ul><li><strong>By time:</strong> keep a five-minute list and a one-hour list.</li><li><strong>By energy:</strong> separate quiet activities from active ones.</li><li><strong>By place:</strong> make different lists for home, school, park or travel.</li><li><strong>By budget:</strong> create a free-only list for days when spending is off the table.</li></ul></section><section><h2>Accessibility and safety still matter</h2><p>The picker cannot know whether an activity is accessible, age-appropriate or safe in your environment. Adults and facilitators should check those things before adding the option. For classroom use, participation methods should fit student needs and school policies.</p></section><section><h2>Make your own prompt library</h2><p>If you find a list that works well, copy it into a notes app so it is easy to paste back later. The page does not require an account or save a personal activity profile. That keeps the tool simple and means you remain in control of the list.</p></section></div></main><footer class="footer"><a href="/about">About</a><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a><a href="/terms">Terms</a><a href="/contact/">Contact</a><p>© 2026 Wheel Name Picker · Ascension Digital Group</p></footer><script>const $=id=>document.getElementById(id),sets={home:['Board game','Short walk','Draw something','Watch a movie','Bake something','Read together','Do a puzzle','Music session'],class:['30-second stretch','Desk tidy challenge','Quick doodle prompt','Silent charades','Word association round','Five deep breaths','Stand and balance','Two-minute movement break'],outside:['Nature walk','Kick a ball','Cloud spotting','Garden task','Scavenger hunt','Picnic snack','Take photos','Ride or scooter']};function fill(){ $('items').value=sets[$('preset').value].join('\n');$('result').textContent='List loaded'}function list(){return $('items').value.split(/\n|,/).map(x=>x.trim()).filter(Boolean)}$('load').onclick=fill;$('pick').onclick=()=>{const a=list();$('result').textContent=a.length?a[Math.floor(Math.random()*a.length)]:'Add at least one activity.'};</script></body></html>